        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.107,
            0.886,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note that 2x + 3 is a linear function, whereas "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 x - X ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is a quadratic function."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.373,
            0.18,
            0.623,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Exercise Set 2.2"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.233,
            0.79,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Find the value of the linear polynomial 5x – 3 if: (i) x = 0 (ii) x = –1 (iii) x = 2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.291,
            0.79,
            0.342
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Find the value of the quadratic polynomial "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7s^{2}-4s+6\\  if :"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (i) s = 0 (ii) s = –3 (iii) s = 4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.351,
            0.885,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. The present age of Salil’s mother is three times Salil’s present age. After 5 years, their ages will add up to 70 years. Find their present ages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.417,
            0.885,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. The difference between two positive integers is 63. The ratio of the two integers is 2:5. Find the two integers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.462,
            0.886,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Ruby has 3 times as many two-rupee coins as she has five rupee-coins. If she has a total `88, how many coins does she have of each type?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.528,
            0.886,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. A farmer cuts a 300 feet fence into two pieces of different sizes. The longer piece is four times as long as the shorter piece. How long are the two pieces?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.593,
            0.885,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. If the length of a rectangle is three more than twice its width and its perimeter is 24 cm, what are the dimensions of the rectangle?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.655,
            0.549,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.3 Exploring linear patterns"
